# MODULE bounded guest interpreter with six logical guest cells
# PURPOSE execute all eight original BF commands under exact charged guest fuel
# INPUT fuel byte source length source bytes guard input length input bytes guard
# OUTPUT status executed count output count source offset then guest output bytes
# TAPE source input guest tape and pending output occupy disjoint fixed windows
# TAPE bounded arrays hold thirty two original guest commands and sixteen byte streams
# TAPE BF interpreter scratch locations are kept outside persistent guest state
# LIMITATION diagnostic record not a trusted filesystem or host closure protocol
# LIMITATION fixed per invocation prototype budgets and no native Android execution
# LIMITATION source offset of unmatched opening is currently not reported
# SAFETY validate all available source bytes and brackets before guest effects
# SAFETY charge original bracket operations but not commands skipped inside loops
# SAFETY report left and right boundary traps and checked instruction exhaustion
# SAFETY output failure includes exact previously buffered output count
# END header

